<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>PUNK TACTICS</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Joey Valence &amp; Brae</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">PUNK TACTICS</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2jQ1P0aGT4WkNyJCeoQnb9</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.941" end="00:10.441">[Intro: Brae]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.609" end="00:11.686">Yo, yo, yo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.686" end="00:15.766">If you don't shut your mouth, I'ma shut it for you, punk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.766" end="00:17.266">[Chorus: Brae, Joey Valence &amp; Brae &amp; Joey Valence]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.151" end="00:18.401">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.401" end="00:20.824">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.824" end="00:23.250">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.250" end="00:25.564">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.564" end="00:27.064">[Verse 1: Joey Valence &amp; Brae]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.830" end="00:27.663">Hit you with the hard punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.663" end="00:30.375">Bankrolls come straight for the assets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.375" end="00:32.480">No games, no throw, won't pass it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.480" end="00:35.657">Pick you up, spit you out like Jurassic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.657" end="00:37.287">Oh, known for the rigmarole</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.287" end="00:41.003">We kick pros, stub toes, I suppose you might know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.003" end="00:42.906">Hit the block, then you flock</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.906" end="00:45.748">Time's up, now you 'bout to get clocked (Aye)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.748" end="00:48.392">Spicy like pepper, one-two stepper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.392" end="00:50.829">Laid back, motivated money go-getter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.829" end="00:53.190">Never felt better, write me lovе letters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.190" end="00:55.797">Shootin' out the spikе chain, Megadeth tether</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.797" end="00:57.610">Get over here like Scorpion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.610" end="01:00.557">Put you to sleep, Kevorkian</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.557" end="01:03.176">Should I assist ya, or do you get the picture?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.176" end="01:04.878">If you don't budge I'ma gonna have to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.878" end="01:06.378">[Chorus: Brae, Joey Valence &amp; Brae &amp; Joey Valence]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.122" end="01:07.349">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.349" end="01:09.791">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.791" end="01:12.235">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.235" end="01:14.506">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.506" end="01:16.006">[Verse 2: Joey Valence &amp; Brae]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.883" end="01:17.219">Yo, the laces loose and fists tight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.219" end="01:19.810">I never lose a fist fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.810" end="01:22.118">Son, I've been up all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.118" end="01:24.487">If I'm gonna do it, then I'm gonna do it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.487" end="01:26.799">B to the R to the A to the E</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.799" end="01:29.334">F what you think, I'ma stay G</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.334" end="01:31.776">H is for hot, 'cause that's what I be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.776" end="01:34.318">I, J, K, I'm cold like Slurpee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.318" end="01:36.740">Ooh, goddamn, I drop bombs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.740" end="01:39.166">I was born with the brains and the brawn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.166" end="01:41.561">I am the king and you're just a pawn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.561" end="01:44.112">Who's got the high ground now, Obi-Wan?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.112" end="01:46.525">Alphabet rhymes like chicken noodle soup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.525" end="01:48.993">Two-door Bimmer, pick you up in the coupe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.993" end="01:51.386">Shootin' for the hoop, jiggy on the loose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.386" end="01:53.772">Shark mentality like my name Bruce</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.772" end="01:55.272">[Bridge: Brae &amp; Joey Valence]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.121" end="01:56.412">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.412" end="01:58.783">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.783" end="02:01.401">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.401" end="02:03.458">Ahh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.458" end="02:04.958">[Chorus: Brae, Joey Valence &amp; Brae &amp; Joey Valence]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.843" end="02:06.091">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.091" end="02:08.540">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.540" end="02:10.935">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.935" end="02:13.481">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.481" end="02:15.870">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.870" end="02:18.290">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.290" end="02:20.780">Hit ya (Hit ya) with the (With the) punk (Punk) tactics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.780" end="02:24.780">Hit ya– Hit ya with– with the– with the punk tactics</p></div></body></tt>